<svg
  class="qbj-svg"
  viewBox="0 0 600 490"
  role="img"
  aria-label="气血津液关系示意图"
>
  <title>气血津液关系示意图</title>
  <desc>
    气在上，血与津液在下，三者以虚线相连。气为血帅、血为气母；气能生津行津、津能载气；津血同源。
  </desc>

  <line class="qbj-line" x1="300" y1="90" x2="140" y2="360"></line>
  <line class="qbj-line" x1="300" y1="90" x2="460" y2="360"></line>
  <line class="qbj-line" x1="140" y1="360" x2="460" y2="360"></line>

  <text class="qbj-center" x="300" y="275" text-anchor="middle">同源 · 互根</text>

  <text class="qbj-label" x="190" y="220" text-anchor="middle">气为血帅</text>
  <text class="qbj-label" x="190" y="237" text-anchor="middle">血为气母</text>
  <text class="qbj-label" x="410" y="220" text-anchor="middle">气生津行津</text>
  <text class="qbj-label" x="410" y="237" text-anchor="middle">津能载气</text>
  <text class="qbj-label" x="300" y="410" text-anchor="middle">津血同源</text>

  <g class="qbj-node qbj-node--qi">
    <circle cx="300" cy="90" r="68"></circle>
    <text class="qbj-title" x="300" y="88" text-anchor="middle">气</text>
    <text class="qbj-note" x="300" y="116" text-anchor="middle">推动 · 温煦</text>
  </g>

  <g class="qbj-node qbj-node--blood">
    <circle cx="140" cy="360" r="68"></circle>
    <text class="qbj-title" x="140" y="358" text-anchor="middle">血</text>
    <text class="qbj-note" x="140" y="386" text-anchor="middle">濡养 · 化神</text>
  </g>

  <g class="qbj-node qbj-node--fluid">
    <circle cx="460" cy="360" r="68"></circle>
    <text class="qbj-title" x="460" y="358" text-anchor="middle">津液</text>
    <text class="qbj-note" x="460" y="386" text-anchor="middle">润泽 · 充养</text>
  </g>
</svg>
